		[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS!,Performance!,MFH,PVyes,Battery\
		!]) ) * 
	Probability adoption RCP Renters[District,HS,Performance,MFH] , 
	
	( SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVpanel!,Battery!]) * Share of buildings with suitable roof\
		[District,MFH] * ( 1 - Share of owned houses[MFH] ) - 
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) * ( Rented buildings with PV\
		[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCP[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCPv\
		[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCPv PVno[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution\
		[District,HS!,Performance!,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) ) * 
	Probability adoption RCP Renters[District,HS,Performance,MFH] * ( 1 - Share urban buildings\
		[District,MFH] ) * Energy Community scenario - 
	
	( SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVpanel!,Battery!]) * Share of buildings with suitable roof\
		[District,MFH] * ( 1 - Share of owned houses[MFH] ) - 
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) * ( Rented buildings with PV\
		[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCP[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCPv\
		[District,MFH] + Rented buildings with RCPv PVno[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution\
