		Retrofit VeryLow SFH Data[Low] * LN( VeryLow to Low SFH MS ) + 
		Retrofit VeryLow SFH Data[Moderate] * LN( VeryLow to Moderate SFH MS ) + 
		Retrofit VeryLow SFH Data[High] * LN( VeryLow to High SFH MS ) + 
		Retrofit VeryLow SFH Data[VeryHigh] * LN( VeryLow to VeryHigh SFH MS ) , 0 \
		) )
	~	:SUPPLEMENTARY 
	|

