Owned buildings with RCP[District,Type]= INTEG (
	Owners adopting RCP flow[District,Type],
		0)
	~	
	~		|

Share of owned houses[Type]=
	0.634,
	0.634,
	0.228
	~	
	~		|

Owned buildings with RCPv PVno[District,Type]= INTEG (
	Owners adopting RCPv PVno flow[District,Type],
		0)
