	IF THEN ELSE ( Time < 2027 , 
	( Cantonal Levy Evolution + Other Cantonal and Municipal tax + Levy Evolution + DSO charge\
		[District] + Energy price[District] + TSO charge ) , 
	( Cantonal Levy Evolution + Other Cantonal and Municipal tax + Levy Evolution + DSO charge\
		[District] + Average energy price market * Energy price[District] / (SUM(Energy price\
		[District!])/8) + TSO charge ) )
	~	CHF/kWh
