DSO charge[Vallemaggia]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time < 2027 , 
	
	Initial DSO charge[Vallemaggia] , 
	
	( Initial DSO expenses[Vallemaggia] + Total annual grid upgrading cost by DSO smooth\
		[Vallemaggia] ) / ( Total annual grid demand Districts[Vallemaggia] + Total annual grid demand Districts\
		[Riviera] + Total annual grid demand Districts[Locarno] + Total annual grid demand Districts\
		[Leventina] + Total annual grid demand Districts[Blenio] ) ) ~~|
