	11.11	12.35	21.03
	10.8	12.05	14.63
	11.6	11.46	13.55
	12.11	11.53	19.67
	10.59	12.02	19.63
	11.32	14.3	20.45
	12.66	15.34	16.4
	10.54	11.62	13.86)
	~	kW
	~		|

PV annual generation per kW=
	1128.26
	~	kWh/kW
	~		|

