		,Type] + 
	Owners adopting RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Renters adopting RCP[District,HS\
		,Performance,Type] + 
	Owners adopting RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Renters adopting RCPv[District,\
		HS,Performance,Type] ~~|
Consumers adopting PV no[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVno,Byes]=
